WEBVTT

00:01:26.275 --> 00:01:30.101
"Not yet, but she might marry
the next one.

00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:34.483
Besides, the best time
to work on Alex's marriage

00:01:34.507 --> 00:01:37.241
is before she has one."

00:01:38.359 --> 00:01:41.250
That's what psychologists
call an "Aha!" moment.

00:01:41.274 --> 00:01:44.384
That was the moment I realized,
30 is not the new 20.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.175
Yes, people settle down later
than they used to,

00:01:47.199 --> 00:01:51.574
but that didn't make Alex's 20s
a developmental downtime.

00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:55.086
That made Alex's 20s
a developmental sweet spot,

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.714
and we were sitting there, blowing it.

00:01:58.507 --> 00:02:02.168
That was when I realized
